## IDEs
.vscode/
.idea/
.env
# The 3proxy directory holds runtime state (logs, .proxyauth) that must stay
# untracked, but the image build copies two config files from it. Ignoring the
# directory outright also dropped those files from every fresh checkout, so the
# Docker build failed on CI with "3proxy-docker.conf: not found". Exclude the
# contents instead of the directory so the two configs can be re-included.
3proxy/*
!3proxy/3proxy.cfg
!3proxy/fail2ban/
!3proxy/fail2ban/3proxy-docker.conf
dist
node_modules
.next
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
dev

